OL,3,GNEWSAScottish National Investment Bank
OL,4,Amakes 'painful' #138m net loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish National Investment Bank
OL,7,Fhas revealed it made a net loss of
OL,8,F#138m last year.
OL,10,FThe state-owned body cited the collapse
OL,11,Fof three of its early investments -
OL,12,Fincluding its first, Glasgow-based
OL,13,Flaser company M Squared.
OL,15,FHowever, the bank also generated an
OL,16,Fincome of #32m, comfortably covering
OL,17,Fits operating costs of #20m.
OL,19,FChairman Willie Watt called the losses
OL,20,F"painful" but said the bank had learned
OL,21,Flessons.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
